      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Notable Constants\n\n- **Astronomical Unit (AU)**: ~1.5 × 10¹¹ m (Earth-Sun distance)\n- **Earth's orbital period**: 365.3 days\n- **Moon's orbital period**: 27.3 days\n- **Surface pressure on Earth**: 1.014 bar\n- **Surface pressure on Venus**: 90 bar\n- **Distance to Proxima Centauri**: 270,000 AU"
